# Content

Client facts live in `src/config/site.ts` and `src/content/*.ts`. Components read those objects. Do not hard-code business data in chrome or sections.

Do not invent awards, certifications, reviews, statistics, named clients, or addresses. Use placeholders:

```ts
phone: "[Phone]",
address: "[Address]",
email: "hello@studio.example",
```

If WhatsApp or Tally is empty, hide the control or show a labeled placeholder plus `mailto:`. Never fake a working form.

Fictional demo copy for Casa Norte may describe the studio’s work. It may not claim real clients, press, or credentials.
